Changelog: 22-11-2026 15:43:13

Added. Nexus Garbage Remover, a development app. It lists the garbage on this machine: crash dumps, Steam's crash
reports, the Trash, picture previews, pip's download cache and Homebrew's downloads, each with its size and the
command that empties it. Delete empties the checked places after it asks, the crash dumps through pkexec. An hourly
timer sends a notification from 1 GB on, once a day or sooner when it grew by 1 GB. Our tools' own leftovers stay
with tools/clean_caches.py.
